---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - Path of Exile 2 Guide"
  description="Learn more about ExileGuide - your ultimate resource for Path of Exile 2 builds, guides, and strategies."
  canonical="https://poe2-guide.vercel.app/about"
>
  <div class="container-custom py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-orbitron font-bold text-white mb-6">
        About <span class="gradient-text">ExileGuide</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-poe max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg text-poe-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          ExileGuide is your premier resource for Path of Exile 2 builds, guides, and strategies.
          We're dedicated to helping both new and experienced players master the content
          of Wraeclast.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          We believe that every exile deserves access to high-quality, up-to-date information
          about Path of Exile 2. Our guides are carefully researched, tested, and maintained
          to ensure they work with the latest game patches.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Build Guides</strong> - Detailed builds for every class, from leveling to endgame</li>
          <li><strong>Farming Strategies</strong> - Efficient methods to earn currency and items</li>
          <li><strong>Leveling Guides</strong> - Fast-track your progression from 1-100</li>
          <li><strong>Beginner Resources</strong> - Everything you need to start your journey</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Our Standards</h2>
        <p>
          Every guide on ExileGuide goes through a rigorous review process. We verify
          that builds work on a realistic budget, that strategies are efficient, and that
          all information is accurate for the current patch.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Have a suggestion or found an error in one of our guides? We'd love to hear from you.
          Reach out to us and help us make ExileGuide better for everyone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
